      "locator": {
        "page": 3,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p3_s1"
      },
      "text": "Also, in order to disguise as a normal file, the Korean file created with the '2022.hwp' command is executed in the folder where the '2022 resume form.vbs' file is executed.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_12",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Ahnlab-APT-disguised-NorthKorean-defector-resume-VBS-script(03-29-2022)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 4,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p4_s1"
      },
      "text": "Also, the %appdata%\\mscornet.vbs file created through the corresponding response is registered in the task scheduler as the Google Update Source Link name.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_13",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
