      "locator": {
        "page": 4,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p4_s2"
      },
      "text": "In addition to this, copy mscornet.vbs to the startup program folder so that the VBS file can be executed automatically, and then self-delete the '2022 resume form.vbs' file.",
